# Web build, selected by `npm run build` (`vite build --mode web`). This is
# what Vercel runs.
#
# An empty base URL means "relative to this origin": the browser calls the
# serverless proxy at /api/*, which injects APICOSTGUARD_GATEWAY_TOKEN
# server-side. It must stay empty -- a non-empty value would send the browser
# straight to the protected backend and the build fails on purpose.
#
# Never put a token here or in any VITE_* variable. VITE_* values are compiled
# into the public bundle.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
